From 90aa17f18e15d3719f377e9fa96479dfbf5a3c5d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 17:51:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 66/85] thunderbolt: Add device links for OF PCIe tunnels

ACPI systems link tunneled native PCIe ports to the NHI so system
and runtime PM restore the tunnel before its PCI consumers. OF platforms
require the same ordering, but the NHI and PCI host bridge may probe in
either order.

Factor out the common link creation and register a PCI bus notifier for
OF-described host bridges. Also scan already registered bridges when the
NHI probes.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
